    "_meta": {
        "purpose": "A frozen fixture for /styleguide/, so the run-summary and trend components have a deterministic target.",
        "why": "The real record at src/_data/testRuns.json changes every time a run is accepted. /tests/ is not a screenshot route so that does not matter there, but /styleguide/ is, and a component whose geometry moved on every accepted run would either fail every baseline or have to be masked out of them — and a masked component is one the visual suite has stopped guarding.",
        "invented": "Every figure here is made up, including the commit hashes. It exists to exercise the renderer, not to report anything. Nothing on a published page reads this file.",
        "covers": "Eight runs so the line has shape, one of them with failures so the ringed marker is in the baseline, and a spread of durations so the vertical axis is not flat."
